ickly found that iron man is  impossible to cage in due to his unibeam  attacks  so we let him take the ground below  stark industries  then it was a case of getting midas  there it was a little easier than  getting him to doom's domain so he  didn't need the tunneled bridge  technique  it was messy though look at this we got  carried away and covered far too much of  the water but i  strangely find this satisfying i digress  over time midas was pulled over to the  man of iron but it quickly became  apparent  he didn't want to fight today always  running away  and then every time we got him close  enough iron man would evaporate half our  squad  but like always we kept going and  madison iron man  locked eyes and began to fight  [Music]  it was ultra one-sided with midas only  firing three or four times  while iron man hit midas with multiple  unibeams  midas was far too defensive and  constantly ran  backwards this wasn't even a fight but  then something changed in midas  he stopped running away and decided to  get involved in the fight  standing his ground and tanking another  blast but this was too little  too late midas was defeated for a second  time today  i hate to say this but midas may be the  weakest boss in fortnite  oh and if you're wondering we bum-rushed  iron man again and  decided to do the conga in celebration  this time happy days  so let's address the elephant in the  room wolverine  it's now his turn to face midas and to  give midas the best chance possible  we decided to bring wolverine up to the  ruins and give midas home advantage  i think you can already guess what's  going to happen here here we go  [Music]  this time midas stood his ground right  away hitting wolverine with shots before  the wood wanderer  even caught his scent but then logan  took the battle to midas  and the two fought hard midas landed  quality shots but wolverine's healing  ability and those special attacks  were too much for the new boss at the  ruins wolverine wins  w